06:40.720 --> 06:43.040
How do we take out the middle element from the starting and the ending?

06:43.040 --> 06:43.960
There are two ways.

06:43.960 --> 06:47.920
Either I write the starting index plus the ending index divided by 2.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.800
Or I write the second way.

06:49.800 --> 06:53.880
The starting index plus the ending index minus the starting index

06:53.880 --> 06:55.440
