07:28.760 --> 07:32.320
I am talking about the basic math here.

07:33.280 --> 07:36.360
I can also convert this formula and bring it here.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.160
How?

07:37.160 --> 07:40.160
If I divide the starting index, then this will be

07:40.160 --> 07:43.280
